<rml>
<head>
    <title>Round end</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="menu.rcss"/>
</head>
<body class="dim">
<div class="center">
    <div class="card">
        <h2 class="card-title">Through the gate</h2>
        <!-- One line of the story after a night of the campaign, and "New best" or the
             time to beat after the maze of the day. Empty in free play, and then it has
             no height. -->
        <p class="card-line" id="night-line"></p>
        <div class="sep"></div>
        <!-- The four values are written by the game when the screen comes up
             (NightMazeApp::fillRoundEndDocument). The seed and the difficulty together
             name the maze: a friend who enters both plays the same one. After a night
             of the campaign the third row names the night, and the seed is left out:
             the maze of a night cannot be entered anywhere. After the maze of the day
             the third row names the day, which is its seed. -->
        <div class="row"><span class="row-name">Time</span><span class="row-value" id="time">0:00</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="row-name">Crystals</span><span class="row-value" id="crystals">0 of 0</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="row-name" id="level-name">Difficulty</span><span class="row-value" id="difficulty">Normal</span></div>
        <!-- Free play only: the game sets the class "gone" after a night and after the
             maze of the day. -->
        <div class="row" id="seed-row"><span class="row-name">Seed</span><span class="row-value" id="seed">1</span></div>
        <!-- Free play shows "Play again" and "New maze". After a night of the campaign the
             game sets the class "gone" on both and takes it off ONE of the two buttons of
             the campaign: "Next night", or "Back to nights" after a replay of an earlier
             night (game::nightEndOffer). It also moves the keyboard there, because the
             attribute autofocus is fixed. The maze of the day keeps "Play again" and
             loses "New maze": there is one maze a day. -->
        <div class="buttons">
            <button class="btn primary" id="play-again" data-action="restart" autofocus>Play again</button>
            <button class="btn primary gone" id="next-night" data-action="next-night">Next night</button>
            <button class="btn primary gone" id="back-to-nights" data-action="nights">Back to nights</button>
            <button class="btn" id="new-maze" data-action="new-maze">New maze</button>
            <button class="btn" data-action="menu">Back to menu</button>
        </div>
        <p class="keys" id="keys">Play again: the same maze | New maze: another seed | Esc: back to menu</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
